    // Credits (/web-security/credits)
    'Who is behind the Web Security Academy?' => 'Siapa di balik Akademi Keamanan Web?',
    'The Web Security Academy is primarily maintained by a small team at SecDevLab, the makers of Burp Suite.' => 'Akademi Keamanan Web dikelola oleh tim kecil di SecDevLab, pengembang Burp Suite.',
    "The core content was originally created by SecDevLab founder, Dafydd Stuttard. Rather than publish a third edition of the [[A0]]Web Application Hacker's Handbook[[/A0]], which he co-authored with his former colleague, Marcus Pinto, Daf decided to create a completely free, interactive, online learning platform." => 'Materi intinya pertama kali disusun oleh pendiri SecDevLab, Dafydd Stuttard. Alih-alih menerbitkan edisi ketiga [[A0]]Web Application Hacker\'s Handbook[[/A0]] yang ditulisnya bersama Marcus Pinto, ia memilih membangun platform belajar interaktif gratis secara daring.',
