    "We add new videos to the site in batches, usually about once per month. We're a small team and can't always process videos as quickly as we'd like." => 'Video baru ditambahkan secara bertahap sekitar sebulan sekali karena kapasitas tim peninjau kami terbatas.',
    'What are the requirements for new video solutions?' => 'Apa saja syarat untuk video solusi baru?',
    'Your video must:' => 'Video Anda wajib memenuhi ketentuan berikut:',
    'Be accurate, clear, and explain how to solve the lab. Ideally, it should help other users understand why they need to perform certain steps, rather than just show them what to do.' => 'Akurat, jelas, serta menjelaskan alasan di balik setiap langkah penyelesaian lab, bukan sekadar menunjukkan klik demi klik.',
    'Demonstrate how to solve a single lab. This makes it much easier for us to embed within the individual lab pages.' => 'Membahas penyelesaian satu lab saja per video agar mudah disematkan pada halaman lab terkait.',
    'Be uploaded to YouTube and publicly accessible. We do not host any videos ourselves and do not support embedding videos from other platforms.' => 'Diunggah ke YouTube dengan akses publik. Kami tidak menghosting berkas video sendiri maupun menyematkan tautan dari platform lain.',
    'Your video must not:' => 'Video Anda dilarang memuat hal berikut:',
    'Contain any sponsored messages or other forms of paid promotion. We will accept videos containing YouTube-generated ads, but please avoid advertising products and services within the main video content.' => 'Pesan sponsor atau promosi berbayar di dalam materi utama. Video dengan iklan otomatis YouTube tetap dapat diterima.',
    'Contain background music.' => 'Musik latar belakang.',
